#. front matter: title
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:2 site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:5
msgid "1. Getting started"
msgstr "1. Първи стъпки"

#. html
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:8
msgid "<span>Session 1</span>"
msgstr "<span>Занятие 1</span>"

#. heading 2
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:11
msgid "What we covered"
msgstr "Какво разгледахме"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:13
msgid "The course: materials on GitHub, the program, the course project."
msgstr "Курсът: материалите в GitHub, програмата, курсовият проект."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:14
msgid "VSCode: text editor vs IDE, the command palette (`Ctrl+Shift+P`), DevTools."
msgstr "VSCode: текстов редактор срещу IDE, command palette (`Ctrl+Shift+P`), DevTools."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:15
msgid "Git and GitHub: `git init`, `git status`, `git add`, `git commit -m`, `git config`, `git remote`, `git push`; Source Control in VSCode."
msgstr "Git и GitHub: `git init`, `git status`, `git add`, `git commit -m`, `git config`, `git remote`, `git push`; Source Control във VSCode."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:17
msgid "JavaScript: what it is, its history (ECMAScript, JSON), JavaScript engines, the DevTools console, Node.js."
msgstr "JavaScript: какво е, историята му (ECMAScript, JSON), JavaScript engines, конзолата на DevTools, Node.js."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:19
msgid "Running JavaScript in the browser (`<script>`) and with Node.js in the terminal."
msgstr "Изпълнение на JavaScript в браузъра (`<script>`) и с Node.js в терминала."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:20
msgid "How a program runs: machine code, compiler vs interpreter, V8."
msgstr "Как се изпълнява една програма: машинен код, компилатор срещу интерпретатор, V8."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:21
msgid "Program structure; variables, values and memory."
msgstr "Структура на програмата; variables, стойности и памет."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:23
msgid "We stopped at **declaring and defining variables**, so the [next lecture](/lectures/02-variables-and-types) starts there."
msgstr "Спряхме при **декларирането и дефинирането на variables**, затова [следващата лекция](/lectures/02-variables-and-types) започва оттам."

#. box title
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:26
msgid "Animations"
msgstr "Анимации"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:27
msgid "**How JavaScript runs your code:** [1. Translators](../animations/jsEngine.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Tokens](../animations/jsEngine.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. AST](../animations/jsEngine.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. Two phases](../animations/jsEngine.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Engine and environment](../animations/jsEngine.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**Как JavaScript изпълнява кода ви:** [1. Преводачи](../animations/jsEngine.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}, [2. Tokens](../animations/jsEngine.html#2){target=\"_blank\"}, [3. AST](../animations/jsEngine.html#3){target=\"_blank\"}, [4. Двете фази](../animations/jsEngine.html#4){target=\"_blank\"}, [5. Engine и среда](../animations/jsEngine.html#5){target=\"_blank\"}"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:29
msgid "**Variables in memory:** [1. Declaring and assigning](../animations/variablesInMemory.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}"
msgstr "**Variables в паметта:** [1. Деклариране и присвояване](../animations/variablesInMemory.html#1){target=\"_blank\"}"

