#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:38
msgid "[Introduction to JavaScript](https://ivapopova-courses.github.io/JS-TS-Basics-Slides/pages/themes/JS_Intro/JS_Intro.html)"
msgstr "[Въведение в JavaScript](https://ivapopova-courses.github.io/JS-TS-Basics-Slides/pages/themes/JS_Intro/JS_Intro.html)"

