msgstr "[Основен синтаксис на JavaScript](https://ivapopova-courses.github.io/JS-TS-Basics-Slides/pages/themes/JS_BasicSyntax/JS_BasicSyntax.html)"

#. heading 2
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:42
