msgstr "Домашно от занятие 1"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:44
msgid "Follow the [setup instructions](https://ivapopova-courses.github.io/JS-TS-Basics-Slides/pages/themes/SetupCourseEnvironment/SetupCourseEnvironment.html#/)."
msgstr "Следвайте [инструкциите за настройка](https://ivapopova-courses.github.io/JS-TS-Basics-Slides/pages/themes/SetupCourseEnvironment/SetupCourseEnvironment.html#/)."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:45
msgid "Create a GitHub account for the course (if you do not have one)."
msgstr "Създайте GitHub акаунт за курса (ако нямате)."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/01-getting-started.md:46
msgid "Create a local git repository for your homework, with a `script.js` (`console.log('Hello')`), and push it to GitHub."
msgstr "Създайте локално git repository за домашните, с файл `script.js` (`console.log('Hello')`), и го качете в GitHub с push."

